    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4eb8130b83bf491f57fc96781f300d6f.avif?t=1588257230\" /></div><br>Tower of Shades is a short game in which you start at the <strong>end</strong> of the protagonist's journey, right at the final boss fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><strong>A game about a boss fight.</strong><br>Battle against a mysterious, arduous, and long rpg styled final boss fight.<br><br><strong>Failure as a mechanic. </strong><br>Every time you die, you learn a new skill.<br><br><strong>Why is there a saved file in my new game?</strong><br>Discover the story behind a mysterious saved file.<br><br><strong>The first self-help styled game.</strong><br>The goal of this game is to hopefully inspire you to improve yourself.<br><br><strong>Old school snes themed soundtrack.</strong><br>Even if you don't buy this game, you gotta check out the soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4583a0156b0187408b4130aa392b2bf8.poster.avif?t=1588257230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4583a0156b0187408b4130aa392b2bf8.webm?t=1588257230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4583a0156b0187408b4130aa392b2bf8.mp4?t=1588257230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4eb8130b83bf491f57fc96781f300d6f.avif?t=1588257230\" /></div><br>Tower of Shades is a short game in which you start at the <strong>end</strong> of the protagonist's journey, right at the final boss fight.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><strong>A game about a boss fight.</strong><br>Battle against a mysterious, arduous, and long rpg styled final boss fight.<br><br><strong>Failure as a mechanic. </strong><br>Every time you die, you learn a new skill.<br><br><strong>Why is there a saved file in my new game?</strong><br>Discover the story behind a mysterious saved file.<br><br><strong>The first self-help styled game.</strong><br>The goal of this game is to hopefully inspire you to improve yourself.<br><br><strong>Old school snes themed soundtrack.</strong><br>Even if you don't buy this game, you gotta check out the soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4583a0156b0187408b4130aa392b2bf8.poster.avif?t=1588257230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4583a0156b0187408b4130aa392b2bf8.webm?t=1588257230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194940/extras/4583a0156b0187408b4130aa392b2bf8.mp4?t=1588257230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
